# Mahimahi traces netsim replays (SPEC §17.2). CI downloads each file from
#   https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ravinet/mahimahi/<commit>/traces/<file>
# into crates/netsim/testdata/traces/ (not committed) and checks it, as sha256sum prints:
#   grep -v '^[#c]' crates/netsim/traces.sum | (cd crates/netsim/testdata/traces && sha256sum -c)
# Tests that need a trace skip when the file is absent and fail when its hash differs.
